# Algorithm with pseudocode

A paragraph with inline math $x + y$ to trigger Temml loading.

:algorithm:
\begin{algorithm}
\caption{Euclid's GCD}
\begin{algorithmic}
\PROCEDURE{Euclid}{$a, b$}
    \IF{$b = 0$}
        \RETURN $a$
    \ELSE
        \RETURN \CALL{Euclid}{$b, a \bmod b$}
    \ENDIF
\ENDPROCEDURE
\end{algorithmic}
\end{algorithm}
::
